OL,3,GNEWSAPolice warned a day before Dover
OL,4,Aprotest, force says
OL,5,
OL,6,FKent Police has said it was made aware
OL,7,Fof the potential for protests in Dover
OL,8,Fthe day before they took place but
OL,9,Finformation "was not fully assessed".
OL,11,FA large group of protesters dressed in
OL,12,Fblack and wearing balaclavas blocked
OL,13,Faccess to the Port of Dover on Saturday
OL,14,Ffor several hours, with witnesses
OL,15,Fhearing chants of "stop the boats".
OL,17,FKent Police had said it did not know
OL,18,Fabout the demonstration in advance,
OL,19,Fleading to accusations of a failure in
OL,20,Fintelligence-gathering.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
