OL,3,GNEWSAPolice warned a day before Dover
OL,4,Aprotest, force says
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the force said a review had found
OL,7,Fit received non-emergency information
OL,8,Flate on Friday which may have allowed
OL,9,Fit to "consider its resourcing", but
OL,10,Fdid not share what it was told. The
OL,11,FHome Office has declined to comment.
